       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CONTROLBREAKDEMO.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 TRANS-TABLE.
           05 TRANS-ENTRY OCCURS 8 TIMES.
               10 TRANS-DEPT PIC X(4).
               10 TRANS-AMOUNT PIC 9(5)V99.
       01 I PIC 9(2).
       01 CURRENT-DEPT PIC X(4).
       01 DEPT-SUBTOTAL PIC 9(6)V99 VALUE 0.
       01 GRAND-TOTAL PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE 0.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE "A100" TO TRANS-DEPT(1)
           MOVE 100.00 TO TRANS-AMOUNT(1)
           MOVE "A100" TO TRANS-DEPT(2)
           MOVE 50.25 TO TRANS-AMOUNT(2)
           MOVE "B200" TO TRANS-DEPT(3)
           MOVE 75.00 TO TRANS-AMOUNT(3)
           MOVE "B200" TO TRANS-DEPT(4)
           MOVE 25.50 TO TRANS-AMOUNT(4)
           MOVE "B200" TO TRANS-DEPT(5)
           MOVE 10.00 TO TRANS-AMOUNT(5)
           MOVE "C300" TO TRANS-DEPT(6)
           MOVE 200.00 TO TRANS-AMOUNT(6)
           MOVE "C300" TO TRANS-DEPT(7)
           MOVE 300.00 TO TRANS-AMOUNT(7)
           MOVE "D400" TO TRANS-DEPT(8)
           MOVE 400.00 TO TRANS-AMOUNT(8)

           MOVE TRANS-DEPT(1) TO CURRENT-DEPT
           PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > 8
               IF TRANS-DEPT(I) NOT = CURRENT-DEPT
                   PERFORM PRINT-SUBTOTAL
                   MOVE TRANS-DEPT(I) TO CURRENT-DEPT
               END-IF
               ADD TRANS-AMOUNT(I) TO DEPT-SUBTOTAL
           END-PERFORM
           PERFORM PRINT-SUBTOTAL
           DISPLAY "GRAND TOTAL: " GRAND-TOTAL
           STOP RUN.

       PRINT-SUBTOTAL.
           DISPLAY "DEPT " CURRENT-DEPT " SUBTOTAL: " DEPT-SUBTOTAL
           ADD DEPT-SUBTOTAL TO GRAND-TOTAL
           MOVE 0 TO DEPT-SUBTOTAL.
